  title: 'Controlling Your Driveway Gates From Your Phone and Smart Home',
  metaTitle: 'Smart Home Driveway Gate Control Surrey | App and Voice Guide',
  metaDescription: 'How to run a Surrey driveway gate from your phone, a smart-home hub, or a voice assistant, what geofencing and auto-open really do, and the security questions to ask before you put your gate on the internet.',
  category: 'Automation',
